e":null,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/vvsJR2Q92aALuo1t6p_WmyHKCI8Zx2Jz29lWeMCVRaUel4zhsuZMJ1AzAbBb42XS05i2mbA2uP5hIJSUvTFDy5QrROQPru2sIQukyYhe2DGQOFC-_uYxx2YtsdWJ94NBYtNK9wx119zmt08GHBejmWlw6Y_--WaEkDR4WpNxFFjEeLjalKhU6dQEWf1uFzCeCF6OXSv-ToqM68Ccgx-btA","attribution":"poweroutage.us"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"backuppowerhub.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://backuppowerhub.com/best-budget-power-stations-under-500/","title":"Best Power Stations Under $500: 7 Budget Picks (2026)","snippet":"Nov 13, 2025 \u2014 #1 \u2013 Anker SOLIX C300X \u2013 Best Overall Value Under $500 . RIVER 2 Max 500 ($329) \u2192 #4 \u2013 Bluetti AC2A \u2013 Best Ultra-Budget Pick Under $150","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":3},"pub_date":1763045578.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/moTOsM0rlTvHQAF7DSjNQl7IMyeoFuSSJMZEXpQhp3MwAt0-bD68BM_VfBJc0if_4N_4UtBNWta-SezZwOrTPG47JAm9KFnGfrnqmdtNXNMTrvhtARx2c5u7-xigBIJW_GSOfe8VMqn-iuml7AFMnSiu1OzH7pQEV0qC7ZB1mYM","attribution":"backuppowerhub.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.goodhousekeeping.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/what-to-buy/home-products/g70424851/top-tested-solar-powered-generators/","title":"8 Best Solar Powered Generators of 2026, Expert Tested","snippet":"Feb 27, 2026 \u2014 Best for Blackouts: Anker SOLIX F1500 Portable Power Station ; Best for Camping: Goal Zero Yeti 500. At the Good Housekeeping Institute Home\u00a0... Read more","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":4},"pub_date":1772207993.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/mRGSPkTO__ueO6nK0xqIaLaCbs945A5Fbw85A2iVtjtUmGbYtyKks0uYySrY45bCMENFoLX_4pghJqdGvB2EhQbUGRyHNWNRjQomm7wPSyIn2LqGZ1AhBvXrK9sowxU_xMkgnBs0gk1nJ5fIdI6TGb-KyITUFVwdAhGUP5kmuofkwOD6Me7Aw9l8hZ1N52-xGgSX0qtU0hWB8qpsQXvM8YFLkwWMG48acbvjA6THokJ9vmVlJwvthSeiYBgN_Wcn","attribution":"www.goodhousekeeping.com"},{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.goodhousekeeping.com/home-products/g70424851/top-tested-solar-powered-generators/","title":"8 Best Solar-Powered Generators for Storm Backup, According to Home Experts","snippet":"Good Housekeeping evaluates eight solar-powered generators for storm and outage backup, ranging from compact travel units to whole-house systems. The Jackery HomePower 3000 is the top mid-size choice, offering 3,072 watts, long battery retention, and enough output for major appliances. The EcoFlow RIVER 3 and Bluetti EB3A are lightweight, affordable options for phones, laptops, and small devices, while the Anker SOLIX F1500 and Goal Zero Yeti 500 balance portability with moderate emergency power. Generac\u2019s GB2000 emphasizes rugged outdoor use, though its battery has a shorter lifespan. For automatic home backup, the Anker Solix F3800 and EcoFlow Delta Pro Ultra can connect to electrical panels, power major appliances, and expand substantially with additional batteries; the Delta Pro Ultra is the most powerful but also the heaviest and most expensive. Testing covered capacity, charging, usability, and durability across laboratories and consumer homes. Buyers should consider wattage, runtime, solar-panel compatibility, battery chemistry, and portability. Solar generators are quieter, emissions-free, and safer indoors than gas models, though gas remains preferable for very high power demands.","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":12},"pub_date":1772207940.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/LTCYDRRg9dD7s_YFJdDXlaMc4SbNiLd7Tvp7ALCkQa0xk1pk7TAyGan1IMKWk7d4cTP1ACf2KvDjMiGiR-PoTPmB6I1UjivUlUFzM5vCxoyQYqL0LPmPmTZHUl9H8DX1In6UiNnSK8QPbqVZ8L0uql5vU8aIRnQWfVhynwL1R0asqENRo0C1k3jYgDGb4pQMfbWBxnHzFYlyi9k3WpeKPFYNg5AWY4HpZ_ncNmSu98tYI0w0GMAFtvKpf2LWCfCS","attribution":"www.goodhousekeeping.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.outdoorgearlab.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.outdoorgearlab.com/topics/camping-and-hiking/best-power-station","title":"The Best Power Stations of 2026 | Lab Tested & Ranked","snippet":"The best value power station for most people is the Anker C1000 Gen 2. It delivers on most people's basic needs, such as getting through a blackout in comfort,\u00a0... Read more","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":5},"pub_date":null,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/vTGLJOFmaZXtMe-wTHKjWVxa4AXEPV-QfLynpMT-ReqW8Yk0eF8TEAM3QLwEtd6ern0tEU-UkkSdFKG6YE9febCMOgCzTn3gJCYygLJDa9Dd0RYCY1PwocFclBC-97Le","attribution":"www.outdoorgearlab.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"www.popularmechanics.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://www.popularmechanics.com/home/g70263124/portable-power-station-presidents-day-sales-2026/","title":"Portable Power Stations Are 55% Off for Presidents' Day","snippet":"A Presidents\u2019 Day roundup highlights seven portable power stations at discounted prices, ranging from compact devices for phones and laptops to large systems for home backup. The Bluetti Elite 100 V2 ($398.99) offers 1,024Wh capacity, 1,800W output, 11 ports, fast charging, and UPS switching; Jackery\u2019s Explorer 1000 V2 ($449) provides 1,500W output and powered a full-size refrigerator for over 18 hours in testing. Smaller options include the 128Wh Bluetti Elite 10 Mini ($199), which weighs four pounds and is airline-friendly, and EcoFlow\u2019s 288Wh Trail 300 DC ($159), designed for small electronics and flexible recharging. Anker\u2019s Solix C1000 ($397) combines 1,056Wh capacity with fast charging and app controls, while the 2,048Wh Solix F2000 ($899.99) adds an RV port, wheels, and 12 outlets. For extensive backup, EcoFlow\u2019s 4,096Wh Delta Pro 3 ($1,999) delivers 4,000W output, supports 120/240V loads, and can expand to 48kWh with extra batteries. The models vary in portability, capacity, and suitability for outages, camping, and larger appliances.","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":14},"pub_date":1770645660.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/r0D31VBENWytho4960glJVXgnuNsliam4H0X4M1h6K1_Khc1C-K7ZQjltkAEsU1gKnqgmgPdWXPXLn4I9AYjT07YsNwJu57VQYQ621c_5dfMkfus6I975zXiibl2eBbzhVsovf_vgu9afwBzMq0J3V8HteWFr8YiQ7s_SN9Jeff90gvV91dc1ulyGO1l0UydqElyRTwyb3Ra0uCRq0-XET1t-Z1CfMMc3z3lR9hnSJo","attribution":"www.popularmechanics.com"}]},{"type":"search_result_group","domain":"nypost.com","entries":[{"type":"search_result","url":"https://nypost.com/2026/09/26/shopping/jackery-explorer-1000-v2-drops-below-500-at-amazon/","title":"Power out? This Jackery station can keep essentials running and it's under $500","snippet":"El art\u00edculo destaca la estaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda port\u00e1til Jackery Explorer 1000 v2, disponible por menos de 500 d\u00f3lares durante las ofertas anticipadas de Prime Big Deal Days de Amazon. Este precio representa su nivel m\u00e1s bajo en los \u00faltimos 30 d\u00edas y la convierte en una opci\u00f3n atractiva para emergencias el\u00e9ctricas, acampadas y actividades al aire libre.\n\nEl dispositivo ofrece una potencia de salida de 1.500 W y una potencia m\u00e1xima de 3.000 W, suficiente para alimentar electrodom\u00e9sticos esenciales, como refrigeradores, y cargar varios dispositivos simult\u00e1neamente. Incluye tres tomas de corriente alterna, dos puertos USB-C de 100 W, un puerto USB-A de 18 W y una toma de 12 V para autom\u00f3vil. Con un peso de aproximadamente 10,9 kg y un asa de transporte, resulta f\u00e1cil de trasladar.\n\nLa estaci\u00f3n puede recargarse en 1,7 horas mediante un enchufe convencional, en aproximadamente una hora con el modo de carga de emergencia o mediante energ\u00eda solar con una entrada de hasta 400 W. Tambi\u00e9n permite supervisar su funcionamiento mediante una aplicaci\u00f3n m\u00f3vil. Incluye una garant\u00eda de tres a\u00f1os, ampliable a cinco mediante registro en l\u00ednea, y una pol\u00edtica de devoluci\u00f3n de 30 d\u00edas.\n\nLas ofertas Prime Big Deal Days se celebrar\u00e1n del 6 al 7 de octubre de 2026 y estar\u00e1n disponibles exclusivamente para miembros de Amazon Prime.","ref_id":{"turn_index":346008,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":15},"pub_date":1790418600.0,"thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/mMyLgf5kh-9t3au-2dcu8MbLTu1Z0gIU-4xTRVgoW8h4uQkp6czWYT1qREa3GF9fK7TGTBo8kCmDXfxL1y7Hy-Ro-62fFY4Xyy9CH1HBpEgtczRg0AVfBu5h7vvIPBqeg-C-DXCzCn3vhg42upaoHXx7Fdrz7T5Ad6qaxjBIsjo","attribution":"nypost.com"}]}],"source_message_ids":["4b322fd7-5317-4dee-82ff-707b2cfa0f6a","393e69d3-9fee-4aa7-b4f7-c3b6ea4cdcfa","c7099c16-5b54-40a6-ae08-c70d7bfdab00"]},"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning","tool_summary_type":"web","tool_icons":["https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.techradar.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.tomsguide.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nymag.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.sfgate.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.wired.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=energiasolarpro.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=powerreadyguide.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=poweroutage.us&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=backuppowerhub.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.goodhousekeeping.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.outdoorgearlab.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.popularmechanics.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=nypost.com&sz=128"],"reasoning_start_time":1793610058.6557312,"cot_version":"v5","conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible":false,"request_id":"11fdee53-87c3-47a0-8eeb-677f21912fad","message_type":"next","turn_exchange_id":"a2fcd8eb-1aa0-4a32-b9be-4ddf6b4deab2","working_turn_id":"a2fcd8eb-1aa0-4a32-b9be-4ddf6b4deab2","model_slug":"gpt-6","default_model_slug":"g